            "detailed_description": "The Guild 2 is the shining successor of the ultra successful medieval life sim, Europe 1400. The Guild 2 is a unique mixture of RPG and life simulation in an immersive middle ages scenario. The player and his party become part of history and can even change it in real-time.<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t\tGo back to the dark middle ages and found a new dynasty! Take care of yourself, because your opponents never sleep! Marry a beautiful wife and make new friends... control your life! Hand down your skills and your descendants will greatly appreciate it!<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Middle Ages come to life!</strong> Experience the end of the middle ages like you have never done before in a beautifully crafted and immersive 3D world.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Everything's realtime.</strong> Walk around the streets and accidentally watch an execution of a prisoner or a rich merchant being robbed by one of your opponents.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Keep your power growing.</strong> Be a successful merchant or a cunning thief and watch your dynasty thrive or fail and see your party and family diminish.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Build your own character.</strong> State-of-the-art role playing features allow you to create your own unique character and play in a party of up to 3 members with different strengths and weaknesses.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "The Guild 2 is the shining successor of the ultra successful medieval life sim, Europe 1400. The Guild 2 is a unique mixture of RPG and life simulation in an immersive middle ages scenario. The player and his party become part of history and can even change it in real-time.<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t\tGo back to the dark middle ages and found a new dynasty! Take care of yourself, because your opponents never sleep! Marry a beautiful wife and make new friends... control your life! Hand down your skills and your descendants will greatly appreciate it!<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Middle Ages come to life!</strong> Experience the end of the middle ages like you have never done before in a beautifully crafted and immersive 3D world.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Everything's realtime.</strong> Walk around the streets and accidentally watch an execution of a prisoner or a rich merchant being robbed by one of your opponents.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Keep your power growing.</strong> Be a successful merchant or a cunning thief and watch your dynasty thrive or fail and see your party and family diminish.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Build your own character.</strong> State-of-the-art role playing features allow you to create your own unique character and play in a party of up to 3 members with different strengths and weaknesses.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
